@startuml usecase
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User

rectangle "Colors Web Application" {
  usecase "Log In" as Login
  usecase "Search Colors" as Search
  usecase "Add Color" as Add
  usecase "Log Out" as Logout
}

' UML actor/use case associations are plain lines (no arrowheads)
User -- Login
User -- Search
User -- Add
User -- Logout

note right of Login
  Account must already exist in the Users table;
  the app has no registration page.
end note

note as Pre
  Precondition: user is logged in.
  readCookie() checks the userId in the session
  cookie when color.html loads and redirects to
  index.html if it is missing or expired (20 min).
  Enforced client side only: the API trusts
  whatever userId it is sent.
end note

Search .. Pre
Add .. Pre
Logout .. Pre
@enduml
